    "body": "One more nit from Claude I'd like you to look at:\n\n> source:155309–155311 (carried over): \"process the frame attributes\" still lacks \"(default false)\" on initialInsertion. The new test's second case, which sets src after insertion, is exactly the call that relies on that default.\n\nIt also had some test suggestions. These are optional as far as I'm concerned:\n\n> WPT PR 62993, frame-javascript-url-load-event.html:\n    - The first test stops at the first load event, so it would miss a second one. iframe_javascript_url_in_src.htm counts events and waits before finishing; doing the same here would catch that.\n    - Optionally, add a case where the javascript: URL removes its own container (javascript:frameElement.remove()), for both elements. That tests the container check without Trusted Types, and nothing in WPT covers it yet.\n    - The WPT PR still needs a reviewer.",
